    "nx01_ingredients": {
      "type": "nx01-ingredients",
      "blocks": {
        "ing_alcar": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "fallback_key": "alcar",
            "category": "Carnitine",
            "name": "Acetyl-L-carnitine",
            "form": "Cellular energy support",
            "amount": "500 mg",
            "description": "<p>Acetyl-L-carnitine, or ALCAR, is a form of carnitine involved in how cells manage energy. It contributes to NX-01’s energy support alongside NMN and CoQ10, with each ingredient playing a different biological role.</p>",
            "tag_1": "Energy",
            "tag_2": "Cognitive Function"
          }
        },
        "ing_citicoline": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "fallback_key": "citicoline",
            "category": "Choline compound",
            "name": "Citicoline",
            "form": "CDP-Choline",
            "amount": "250 mg",
            "description": "<p>Citicoline supplies choline, which the body uses to build cell membranes and make acetylcholine; a chemical messenger involved in attention and memory. Human studies have explored citicoline for focus and recall, with some encouraging findings.</p>",
            "tag_1": "Attention",
            "tag_2": "Memory Recall"
          }
        },
        "ing_nmn": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "fallback_key": "nmn",
            "category": "NAD+ precursor",
            "name": "NMN",
            "form": "Nicotinamide mononucleotide",
            "amount": "250 mg",
            "description": "<p>NMN is a building block the body uses to make NAD+, a molecule involved in energy metabolism and normal cell activity. Its role in NX-01 is to provide this precursor alongside the other energy-related ingredients.</p>",
            "tag_1": "Mental Energy",
            "tag_2": "Vitality"
          }
        },
        "ing_theanine": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "fallback_key": "l-theanine",
            "category": "Amino acid",
            "name": "L-Theanine",
            "form": "Amino acid",
            "amount": "200 mg",
            "description": "<p>L-theanine is an amino acid naturally found in tea. It has been studied for relaxation, responses to stress, and aspects of attention. In NX-01, it is included with the aim of supporting composure during mentally demanding days.</p>",
            "tag_1": "Calm",
            "tag_2": "Problem-Solving"
          }
        },
        "ing_rhodiola": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "fallback_key": "rhodiola",
            "category": "Botanical extract",
            "name": "Rhodiola rosea",
            "form": "3% salidrosides",
            "amount": "200 mg",
            "description": "<p>Rhodiola is a root extract studied for stress-related fatigue and concentration. Its intended role in NX-01 is to support mental stamina when everyday demands feel tiring.</p>",
            "tag_1": "Endurance",
            "tag_2": "Stress resilience"
          }
        },
        "ing_coq10": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "fallback_key": "coq10",
            "category": "Coenzyme",
            "name": "CoQ10",
            "form": "Ubiquinol",
            "amount": "100 mg",
            "description": "<p>CoQ10 is a compound naturally present in the body. Cells use it in the process of producing usable energy, and it also has an antioxidant role. It contributes another part of NX-01’s cellular energy rationale alongside ALCAR and NMN.</p>",
            "tag_1": "Cellular Energy",
            "tag_2": "Clearer Focus"
          }
        },
        "ing_b6": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "fallback_key": "b6",
            "category": "B vitamin",
            "name": "Vitamin B6",
            "form": "Pyridoxal-5-phosphate (P-5-P)",
            "amount": "5 mg",
            "description": "<p>P-5-P is an active coenzyme form of vitamin B6. B6 helps the body process amino acids and make neurotransmitters—the chemical messengers used by the brain and nerves. It also participates in normal energy metabolism. Its role in NX-01 is to supply a nutrient needed for these everyday processes.</p>",
            "tag_1": "Nutritional foundation",
            "tag_2": "Wellbeing"
          }
        },
        "ing_b12": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "fallback_key": "b12",
            "category": "B vitamin",
            "name": "Vitamin B12",
            "form": "Methylcobalamin",
            "amount": "500 mcg",
            "description": "<p>Methylcobalamin is a form of vitamin B12 that helps maintain healthy nerve cells and supports normal blood-cell formation. It also works with folate in essential processes within cells. In NX-01, B12 provides nutritional support for normal brain and nerve function.</p>",
            "tag_1": "Daily energy",
            "tag_2": "Nerve function"
          }
        },
        "ing_folate": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "fallback_key": "folate",
            "category": "B vitamin",
            "name": "Folate",
            "form": "5-MTHF · Vitamin B9",
            "amount": "400 mcg DFE",
            "description": "<p>5-MTHF is a form of folate, also known as vitamin B9. It works with B12 in processes that help the body use amino acids, make DNA, and maintain normal cell function. Together, these vitamins provide part of NX-01’s nutritional foundation.</p>",
            "tag_1": "Nutritional support",
            "tag_2": "Mental clarity"
          }
        }
      },
